{
  "slug": "audit-suite",
  "name": "Audit Suite",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "10 expert audit lenses + full-audit orchestrator + 5 bundled reference skills. Review plans and code through the eyes of\nDesign, UX, Frontend, Backend, Structural, Repo, Production, DX, Performance, and Accessibility engineers.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `audit-as-a11y-eng` (Audit an implementation plan for Accessibility compliance), `audit-as-backend-eng` (Audit an implementation plan through the eyes of a senior Backend/Rust Engineer), `audit-as-design-eng` (Audit an implementation plan through the eyes of a Design Engineer), `audit-as-dx-eng` (Audit an implementation plan through the eyes of a Developer Experience (DX) Engineer), `audit-as-frontend-eng` (Audit an implementation plan through the eyes of a senior Frontend Engineer), `audit-as-perf-eng` (Audit an implementation plan through the eyes of a Performance Engineer), `audit-as-prod-readiness` (Audit an implementation plan for Production Readiness), `audit-as-repo-maintainer` (Audit an implementation plan through the eyes of a Repo Maintainer), and 8 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install audit-suite@claude-community` from `Recusive/Orbit-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
